      "title": "Model download",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Z-Image Flat-Color (no SD3.5, no diffusion editing)\n\n**修复要点**: SD3.5+cel img2img 在 denoise>=0.3 时会重塑 Z-Image 几何 → 变成噪声糊脸，\n且 cel 量化本身只分阶不真的去照度。改为 **纯后处理**：Z-Image 直出 → ImageColorQuantize 一步搞定。\n\n**链路**\n```\nUNETLoader(z_image_turbo_int8_convrot)\n  + CLIPLoader(qwen_image, qwen_3_4b_fp8_mixed)\n  + VAELoader(ae)\n  ↓\nModelSamplingAuraFlow(shift=3)\nTextEncodeZImageOmni(prompt)\nConditioningZeroOut(negative)\nEmptyLatentImage(W,H)\n  ↓\nKSampler(seed, 8 steps, cfg=1, res_multistep, simple, denoise=1)\n  ↓\nVAEDecode\n  ├──> SaveImage  (z-image preview, 保留原图对照)\n  └──> ImageColorQuantize\n         mode=palette, levels=6, flatten=4, remove_lighting=1.0\n         → SaveImage  (z-image-flatcolor, 最终图标)\n```\n\n**ImageColorQuantize 参数**\n- `remove_lighting=1.0` (关键): 同态照度归一化，去掉低频亮/暗面，让 lit/shadow 同色。\n- `mode=palette` (关键): median-cut 合并相似色，比 cel 抗 JPEG 噪声更强。\n- `levels=6`: 主色数量。颜色丰富想硬边可降到 4，纯净手绘感升到 8。\n- `flatten=4`: 双边滤波半径，去除高频光斑同时保边。\n\n**自定义节点**: `custom_nodes/ComfyUI-PipelineHelpers/nodes.py::ImageColorQuantize`\n本工作流依赖该节点新加的 `remove_lighting` 控件。修改 nodes.py 后必须**重启 ComfyUI** 才生效。\n\n**调参**\n- 颜色仍嫌多 → 改 levels=4 / flatten=6\n- 桌面阴影/高光还有残留 → remove_lighting=0.7~1.0\n- 想保留少量明暗立体感 → remove_lighting=0.4, levels=8\n- 几何被破坏 → 检查 Z-Image 是否成功（看 z-image preview SaveImage 输出）\n"
      ],
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    },
