        "flat design illustration, solid color blocks, single flat solid colour per shape, hard-edged, clean flat shapes, flat shading, no gradient, no shadow, no highlight, no ambient occlusion, no smooth shading ramp, orthographic, 2D game asset icon, cel shaded, minimalist, simple geometric, a wooden workbench with a circular saw, game icon\n\n生成一个锯木台的 图片. 通体减少金属成分,大多通过木头组成,木头颜色黑胡桃木色,台面有齿轮转头可以切割木头,位于桌面中间, lowpoly卡通风格, 需要没有光照, 纯色块, 不要渐变",
